{'symbol': 'AIG', 'date': '2022-05-23 09:15:00', 'title': 'AIG RELEASES SECOND ENVIRONMENTAL, SOCIAL AND GOVERNANCE (ESG) REPORT', 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AMERICAN INTERNATIONAL GROUP, INC. (NYSE: AIG) TODAY RELEASED ITS 2021 ENVIRONMENTAL, SOCIAL AND GOVERNANCE (ESG) REPORT. THE 2021 ESG REPORT BUILDS UPON AIG'S INAUGURAL ESG REPORT PUBLISHED LAST YEAR, WHICH PROVIDED THE COMPANY'S FIRST HOLISTIC VIEW OF ITS EFFORTS TO SUPPORT A MORE SUSTAINABLE, EQUITABLE AND PROSPEROUS FUTURE. GUIDED BY AIG'S NEW PURPOSE AND VALUES STATEMENT, THE REPORT'S THEME IS REIMAGINING WHAT AIG CAN DO, AND EXPLORES THE POSITIVE OUTCOMES AIG CA"}